A Function: find_route
  Categories :
  1 memory
    * not enough memory			[error]
    * enough free memory		[property free_mem]
  2 departure
    * blank				[error]
    * exists				[property depart_ok]
    * non existant			[error]
  3 destination
    * blank				[error]
    * exists				[property dest_ok]
    * non existant			[error]
  4 validity
    * route exists			[if (depart_ok) and (dest_ok)] [property route_exists]
    * route does not exist		[if (depart_ok) and (dest_ok)] [property no_route_exists]
  5 route_returned
    * route returned			[if (depart_ok) and (dest_ok)] [property route_found]
    * no route returned			[if (depart_ok) and (dest_ok)] [property no_route_found]
  6 result
    * right route found			[if (route_exists) and (route_found)] [property right_route]
    * no route found			[if (no_route_exists) and (no_route_found)] [property no_route]
    * wrong route found			[if (route_exists) and (route_found)]
    * found non existent route		[if (no_route_exists) and (route_found)]
    * failed to find route		[if (route_exists) and (no_route_found)]
  7 distance
    * right distance			[if right_route]
    * wrong distance			[if right_route]
EndFunction;
